The GeoJSON data file (P29-23_23.geojson) is derived from:
"国土数値情報（学校データ P29-2023）" provided by Ministry of Land, Infrastructure,
Transport and Tourism (MLIT), Japan.

Source: https://nlftp.mlit.go.jp/ksj/gml/datalist/KsjTmplt-P29-2023.html

